    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate</code></a> using the given <a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>converter</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>converter</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>query</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>query</code> 不能为空。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that the <code>GridFSBucket</code> is obtained only once from\n<a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html#getMongoDatabase()\"><code>MongoDatabase</code></a>. Use\n<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert.MongoConverter,reactor.core.publisher.Mono,org.springframework.core.io.buffer.DataBufferFactory)\"><code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate(MongoConverter, Mono, DataBufferFactory)</code></a> if you want to use different buckets from\nthe same Template instance.",
      "translation": "请注意，<code>GridFSBucket</code> 仅从 <a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html#getMongoDatabase()\"><code>MongoDatabase</code></a> 获取一次。如果您希望使用同一个模板实例访问不同的存储桶，请使用 <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert.MongoConverter,reactor.core.publisher.Mono,org.springframework.core.io.buffer.DataBufferFactory)\"><code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate(MongoConverter, Mono, DataBufferFactory)</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>dbFactory</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>dbFactory</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate</code></a> using the given <a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emitting a\n<a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>、发出 <a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 以及 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a>，创建一个新的 <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate</code></a> using the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> and <a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/buffer/DataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DataBufferFactory</code></a>、<a href=\"../ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../core/convert/MongoConverter.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.convert\"><code>MongoConverter</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsTemplate.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emitting the frist <code>GridFSFile</code> matching the given\nquery or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> in case no file matches.",
      "translation": "返回一个发出与给定查询匹配的第一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 的 <code>GridFSFile</code>，或者在没有任何文件匹配时返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emitting the <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsResource</code></a> for a <code>GridFSFile</code>.",
      "translation": "返回一个发出对应于<code>GridFSFile</code>的<a href=\"ReactiveGridFsResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsResource</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emitting the <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsResource</code></a> with the given file name.",
      "translation": "返回一个发出具有给定文件名的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 的 <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsResource</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a> emitting all <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsResource</code></a>s matching the given file name pattern.",
      "translation": "返回一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>，该 Flux 会发出所有匹配给定文件名称模式的 <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsResource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsResource</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Compute the <code>GridFSUploadOptions</code> to be used from the given contentType and metadata\n<code>Document</code>.",
      "translation": "根据给定的 contentType 和元数据 <code>Document</code>，计算用于的 <code>GridFSUploadOptions</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Deletes all files matching the given <a href=\"../core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>.",
      "translation": "删除所有与给定<a href=\"../core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>匹配的文件。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert a given value into a <code>Document</code>.",
      "translation": "将给定值转换为<code>Document</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> if not match found.",
      "translation": "如果未找到匹配项，则使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> if no match found.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"类或接口在 reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a>（如果未找到匹配项）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>bucket</code> - can be null.",
      "translation": "<code>bucket</code> - 可为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>dataBufferFactory</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>dataBufferFactory</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>contentType</code> - can be null.",
      "translation": "<code>contentType</code> - 可以为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>metadata</code> - can be null",
      "translation": "<code>metadata</code> - 可为 null",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>callback</code> - must not be null",
      "translation": "<code>callback</code> 不能为 null",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "never null.",
      "translation": "永不为空。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emitting a single <code>GridFSFile</code> matching the given\nquery or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> in case no file matches. <br/>\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> If more than one file matches the given query the resulting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emits an error. If\nyou want to obtain the first found file use <a href=\"ReactiveGridFsOperations.html#findFirst(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query.Query)\"><code>ReactiveGridFsOperations.findFirst(Query)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个发出单个与给定查询匹配的<code>GridFSFile</code>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>，或者在没有任何文件匹配时返回<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a>。<br/>\n<strong>注意：</strong>如果有多于一个文件匹配给定查询，则生成的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>将发出错误。如果您想获取找到的第一个文件，请使用<a href=\"ReactiveGridFsOperations.html#findFirst(org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query.Query)\"><code>ReactiveGridFsOperations.findFirst(Query)</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Stores the given <a href=\"GridFsObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsObject</code></a>, likely a <a href=\"GridFsUpload.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsUpload</code></a>, into into a file with given\n<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFilename()\"><code>name</code></a>. If the <a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFileId()\"><code>GridFsObject.getFileId()</code></a> is set, the file will be stored\nwith that id, otherwise the server auto creates a new id. <br/>",
      "translation": "将给定的<a href=\"GridFsObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsObject</code></a>（可能为<a href=\"GridFsUpload.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsUpload</code></a>）存储到具有指定<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFilename()\"><code>name</code></a>的文件中。如果已设置<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFileId()\"><code>GridFsObject.getFileId()</code></a>，则文件将使用该 id 进行存储；否则，服务器会自动创建一个新的 id。<br/>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a> emitting all files matching the given query. <br/>\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> Currently <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> criteria defined at the <a href=\"../core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> will not be regarded as MongoDB\ndoes not support ordering for GridFS file access.",
      "translation": "返回一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>，用于发射所有匹配给定查询的文件。<br/>\n<strong>注意：</strong> 当前在 <a href=\"../core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> 中定义的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 条件不会被 MongoDB 视为 GridFS 文件访问的排序依据，因为 MongoDB 不支持对 GridFS 文件进行排序。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ReactiveGridFsOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>ReactiveGridFsOperations</code></a> implementation to store content into MongoDB GridFS. Uses by default\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/buffer/DefaultDataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>DefaultDataBufferFactory</code></a> to create <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/buffer/DataBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.buffer\"><code>buffers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ReactiveGridFsOperations.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs 中的接口\"><code>ReactiveGridFsOperations</code></a> 接口的实现，用于将内容存储到 MongoDB GridFS。默认情况下，使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/buffer/DefaultDataBufferFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.io.buffer 中的类或接口\"><code>DefaultDataBufferFactory</code></a> 来创建 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/buffer/DataBuffer.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.io.buffer 中的类或接口\"><code>buffers</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Stores the given <a href=\"GridFsObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsObject</code></a>, likely a <a href=\"GridFsUpload.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsUpload</code></a>, into into a file with given\n<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFilename()\"><code>name</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <a href=\"GridFsObject.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsObject</code></a>（可能是 <a href=\"GridFsUpload.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.gridfs\"><code>GridFsUpload</code></a>）存储到具有给定<a href=\"GridFsObject.html#getFilename()\"><code>name</code></a>的文件中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> emitting a single <code>GridFSFile</code> matching the given\nquery or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a> in case no file matches.",
      "translation": "返回一个发出单个与给定查询匹配的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> 的 <code>GridFSFile</code>，或者在没有任何文件匹配时返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html#empty()\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono.empty()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a reusable Mono for a <code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate.ReactiveBucketCallback</code>. It's up to the developer to choose to obtain a new\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a> or to reuse the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为<code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate.ReactiveBucketCallback</code>创建一个可重用的 Mono。至于选择获取一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>还是复用该<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>，则由开发者自行决定。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a reusable Flux for a <code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate.ReactiveBucketCallback</code>. It's up to the developer to choose to obtain a new\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a> or to reuse the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为<code>ReactiveGridFsTemplate.ReactiveBucketCallback</code>创建一个可复用的 Flux。由开发者自行决定是获取一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>还是复用该<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
